&lt;p&gt;Wonderful! We are saving time :D&lt;&#x2F;p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;scan-overview&quot;&gt;Scan overview&lt;&#x2F;h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Scan provides a running total of a list. Using some clever message passing we can parallelize this.&lt;&#x2F;p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Example using addition:&lt;&#x2F;p&gt;
&lt;pre data-lang=&quot;gleam&quot; class=&quot;language-gleam z-code&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-gleam&quot; data-lang=&quot;gleam&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-text z-plain&quot;&gt;parallel_scan([40, -200, 600, 5], fn(a, b) { a + b })
&lt;&#x2F;span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-text z-plain&quot;&gt;&#x2F;&#x2F; Returns -&amp;gt; [40, -160, 440, 445]
&lt;&#x2F;span&gt;&lt;&#x2F;code&gt;&lt;&#x2F;pre&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Another example with multiplication&lt;&#x2F;p&gt;
&lt;pre data-lang=&quot;gleam&quot; class=&quot;language-gleam z-code&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-gleam&quot; data-lang=&quot;gleam&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-text z-plain&quot;&gt;parallel_scan([40, -200, 600, 5], fn(a, b) { a * b })
&lt;&#x2F;span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-text z-plain&quot;&gt;&#x2F;&#x2F; Returns -&amp;gt; [40, -8000, -480000, -2400000]
&lt;&#x2F;span&gt;&lt;&#x2F;code&gt;&lt;&#x2F;pre&gt;
